      "date": "2026-02-15T23:58:15.000Z",
      "title": "Second quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.09 (vs ₹0.03 in 2Q 2025)",
      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.09 (up from ₹0.03 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹110.3m (up 28% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹26.8m (up 157% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 24% (up from 12% in 2Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 5% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 4% per year.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
